CHAPTER III

RIGHTS OF VICTIMS

Article 4

1. Every victim of gender-based violence and children has the right to:a. obtain protection for the security of themselves, their families, and their property, and be free from threats related to information that will be, is being, or has been provided;
b. participate in the process of selecting and determining the form of protection and security support;
